flowchart LR
    U[User or App] --> GW[AI Gateway]
    GW --> IN[Input Guardrails]
    IN --> P[Prompt Orchestrator]
    P --> R[RAG Retriever]
    R --> V[Vector DB]
    V --> KB[Governed Knowledge Base]
    P --> LLM[LLM Provider or Internal Model]
    LLM --> OUT[Output Guardrails]
    OUT --> RESP[Response with Sources]
    RESP --> U
    GW --> LOG[Audit Logs]
    OUT --> MON[GenAI Monitoring]
    MON --> SIEM[SIEM]
